From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rumisle <why-excuse-quail@duck.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 23:48:47 +0800
Subject: gui-extensions: the titlebar Update pill for an ocelot service

A service that restarts into a new binary once idle reports it through
/api/ocelot/restart. A small built-in extension (ocelot-update, web only) adds
the titlebar "Update" status pill, which restarts the server now and reloads into
the new UI; after a restart the stale page offers a reload the same way.

Ocelot-Patch: web/service-update

